      "role": "user",
      "content": "we try talking but it doesn't change the reality of it. he has to sacrifice his whole life for me. his hobbies, his sleep, his career... it's all just being used to manage my decline. it's not like he has a choice, but it feels like i'm just stealing his life away one day at a time. it's hard to see it as anything other than being a parasite.",
