      "content": "idk. counseling doesn't stop the fact that i'm a drain on him. it just makes him feel like he has to be my therapist too. i look at him and i just see all the things he could be doing if i wasn't here. he'd be so much lighter, so much freer... it almost feels more selfish to keep clinging to life when it's clearly costing him everything.",
